      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想在赛场上飞驰、\n真正一直在追寻着的东西，\n应该并不是迷人景致本人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "abb202b5bfac504a1ed3b3341cffb9c451191aaae2c954b45c42f10e23a0c0b2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136310.json",
      "json_path": [
